      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.6",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Subject to this section, this Act commences on the day on which it\nreceives the Royal Assent.\n\n(2) Schedule 1 commences, or is taken to have commenced, on 1 July\n2000.",
