      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6 After subsection 20(2)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 7,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(2A) In deciding whether to make a declaration under subsection (1) or\n(2) in relation to a person and an area, the Minister is limited to\nconsidering factors that are relevant to achieving the objects of this\nAct.\n\n(2B) If an agreement under section 56 or 57 of the Telstra Corporation\nAct 1991 made between the Commonwealth and a person\n(including a State or Territory) is expressed to also have effect for\nthe purposes of this subsection, the Minister is taken to have made\n(and to properly have made) a declaration (the deemed\ndeclaration) under subsection (2) that the person is a regional\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments relating to the universal service regime"
    },
