    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "7 Subsections 20(4), (5), (6), (7) and (8)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsections, substitute:\n\n(4) A declaration under subsection (1) or (2) takes effect on the day\nspecified for the purpose in the declaration. That day must not be a\nday before the declaration is made.\n\nAmendments relating to the universal service regime  Schedule 1\nAmendments  Part 1\n\nTelecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act (No. 1) 2000\nNo. 95, 2000            5\n\n(5) A revocation of a declaration under subsection (1) or (2) takes\neffect on the day specified for the purpose in the instrument of\nrevocation. That day must not be a day before the instrument is\nmade.",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the subsections, substitute:\n\n(4) A declaration under subsection (1) or (2) takes effect on the day\nspecified for the purpose in the declaration. That day must not be a\nday before the declaration is made.\n\nAmendments relating to the universal service regime  Schedule 1\nAmendments  Part 1\n\nTelecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act (No. 1) 2000\nNo. 95, 2000            5\n\n(5) A revocation of a declaration under subsection (1) or (2) takes\neffect on the day specified for the purpose in the instrument of\nrevocation. That day must not be a day before the instrument is\nmade.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-7-ss-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-7-ss-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "45006b563b2fa2182b7ea81cca2aac16faa404d7946d1c0f51f91fbff6cf069d"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "7 Subsections 20(4), (5), (6), (7) and (8)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 8,
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsections, substitute:\n\n(4) A declaration under subsection (1) or (2) takes effect on the day\nspecified for the purpose in the declaration. That day must not be a\nday before the declaration is made.\n\nAmendments relating to the universal service regime  Schedule 1\nAmendments  Part 1\n\nTelecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act (No. 1) 2000\nNo. 95, 2000            5\n\n(5) A revocation of a declaration under subsection (1) or (2) takes\neffect on the day specified for the purpose in the instrument of\nrevocation. That day must not be a day before the instrument is\nmade."
    },
