      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "25 Subsection 26(1)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 13,
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n\n(1) For the purposes of this section, there is a multiple provider\nsituation if there are 2 or more regional universal service providers\nfor all or part of the same area."
    },
