      "cof:title": "16 Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Amendment Act",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 20,
      "values:originalText": "(No. 1) 2000       No. 95, 2000\nthe ACA must, in dealing with the notice, comply with this section\nwithin 75 days after the end of that financial year."
    },
