      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.20",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(aa) if a determination under subsection (1A) covering the person\nand that financial year has effect for the person and the\nfinancial year—the person’s net universal service cost for the\nfinancial year is:\n\n(i) if the determination specifies an amount as the person’s\nnet universal service cost for the financial year—that\namount; or\n\n(ii) if the determination specifies a method for working out\nthe person’s net universal cost for the financial year—\nthe amount worked out in accordance with the\ndetermination;",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n\n(aa) if a determination under subsection (1A) covering the person\nand that financial year has effect for the person and the\nfinancial year—the person’s net universal service cost for the\nfinancial year is:\n\n(i) if the determination specifies an amount as the person’s\nnet universal service cost for the financial year—that\namount; or\n\n(ii) if the determination specifies a method for working out\nthe person’s net universal cost for the financial year—\nthe amount worked out in accordance with the\ndetermination;",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-68-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-68-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-68-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c664508acfba7f0cdf1758816775342521baac2cf7ee88ce39548b39f46e0315",
      "skos:note": "Person's net universal service cost for the financial year is determined by a specific amount or method."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-68",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "68 Before paragraph 57(1)(a)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 20,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(aa) if a determination under subsection (1A) covering the person\nand that financial year has effect for the person and the\nfinancial year—the person’s net universal service cost for the\nfinancial year is:\n\n(i) if the determination specifies an amount as the person’s\nnet universal service cost for the financial year—that\namount; or\n\n(ii) if the determination specifies a method for working out\nthe person’s net universal cost for the financial year—\nthe amount worked out in accordance with the\ndetermination;"
    },
