      "values:originalText": "(1E) If a determination under subsection (1A) is varied or revoked, the\nfollowing paragraphs apply:\n\n(a) in the case of a variation:\n\n(i) the variation has effect, for the year or each of the years\nto which it purports to apply, whether it was made\nbefore or during the year, or (subject to\nsubparagraph (ii)) after the end of the year; but\n\n(ii) it does not have effect for a year and a particular person\nif it was made after the making of an assessment under\nsection 64 covering the financial year and the person;\nand\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments relating to the universal service regime",
      "skos:definition": "(1E) If a determination under subsection (1A) is varied or revoked, the\nfollowing paragraphs apply:\n\n(a) in the case of a variation:\n\n(i) the variation has effect, for the year or each of the years\nto which it purports to apply, whether it was made\nbefore or during the year, or (subject to\nsubparagraph (ii)) after the end of the year; but\n\n(ii) it does not have effect for a year and a particular person\nif it was made after the making of an assessment under\nsection 64 covering the financial year and the person;\nand\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments relating to the universal service regime",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-70"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-70-ss-1e-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-70-ss-1e-logic-alleninterval-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4488e97859465ec54c66c5fd9a1791ff261beae6cd5117d17d8f46ebc235a255",
      "skos:note": "Variation of determination under subsection (1A) has effect for the year or each of the years to which it purports to apply."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act#sch-1-sec-70-ss-1e",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "70(1E) After subsection 57(1)",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 20,
      "values:originalText": "(1E) If a determination under subsection (1A) is varied or revoked, the\nfollowing paragraphs apply:\n\n(a) in the case of a variation:\n\n(i) the variation has effect, for the year or each of the years\nto which it purports to apply, whether it was made\nbefore or during the year, or (subject to\nsubparagraph (ii)) after the end of the year; but\n\n(ii) it does not have effect for a year and a particular person\nif it was made after the making of an assessment under\nsection 64 covering the financial year and the person;\nand\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments relating to the universal service regime"
    },
