      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.23",
      "values:originalText": "Add:\nNote:\nA method or amount specified in a determination under this\nsubsection must not take into account any grant that has been or may\nbe made to a person under section 56 or 57 of the Telstra Corporation\nAct 1991—see section 61AA.",
      "skos:definition": "Add:\nNote:\nA method or amount specified in a determination under this\nsubsection must not take into account any grant that has been or may\nbe made to a person under section 56 or 57 of the Telstra Corporation\nAct 1991—see section 61AA.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
