      "cof:title": "82 New subsection 20(2B)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 25,
      "values:originalText": "Subsection 20(2B) of the amended Act applies in relation to an\nagreement referred to in that subsection, whether made before, on or\nafter the commencement."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act-sch-1-sec-82-norm",
