      "dc:source": "telecommunications-consumer-protection-and-service-standards-amendment-act.pdf, p.26",
      "values:originalText": "Section 61AA of the amended Act applies in relation to the financial\nyear in which the commencement occurs and later financial years.\n\n[Minister’s second reading speech made in—\nHouse of Representatives on 10 May 2000\nSenate on 22 June 2000]\n\n(83/00)",
      "skos:definition": "Section 61AA of the amended Act applies in relation to the financial\nyear in which the commencement occurs and later financial years.\n\n[Minister’s second reading speech made in—\nHouse of Representatives on 10 May 2000\nSenate on 22 June 2000]\n\n(83/00)",
